d0fa41d0b.mp4?t=1787405442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment can alter abilities and the entities you can encounter. One armor set may influence how long negative statuses last, while a mask can change how enemies approach you in combat. All items serve a purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/11d78f34e554f491c9ee6864370b1278.avif?t=1787405442\" width=462 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.poster.avif?t=1787405442\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.webm?t=1787405442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/b1d98c7f8f9a177bdbcbe7ba26e332c1.mp4?t=1787405442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items replenish at certain points in your journey instead of disappearing when consumed, so put them to good use. Collect the same item multiple times to upgrade it, but be warned: even equipment found in the realm of dreams has its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294440/extras/3c315ff77ebadac3a5514ae37d2f2613.avif?t=1787405442\" width=461 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i